From 1d65c172c7902a8e2ee192fb972ddd75f2262a70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:04:30 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed equalizer in the quick settings sidebar

Adds the redesign's equalizer card to the Audio tab of the player's quick settings: an on/off switch, the preset list, then Preamp and the ten bands, each with a dB field over a -20 to +20 dB slider. Changes apply to the playing audio and are saved to the configuration like the classic Equalizer panel, through new VLCSettings equalizer methods.
